    "detailed_description": "<h1>JION OUR DISCORD</h1><p><br>DISCORD:</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>The clinic named &quot;Chest&quot; is a treatment facility for dreams, where you can treat the strange illness of not dreaming. &quot;Not dreaming&quot; may not seem very important to you as a modern person, after all, excessive indulgence in dreams may affect real life. However, if someone loses the ability to dream, then they are truly pitiful. So, let's begin. Enjoy your daydreams at Chest and regain the ability to dream. Perhaps, there might be unexpected gains?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905350/extras/28c5ad693e31adb72f9b1e921148844f.poster.avif?t=1753099496\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905350/extras/28c5ad693e31adb72f9b1e921148844f.webm?t=1753099496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905350/extras/28c5ad693e31adb72f9b1e921148844f.mp4?t=1753099496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Take the pill and start &quot;dreaming&quot;!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905350/extras/6806c0336ab6b739d1170dbf27e2bd38.poster.avif?t=1753099496\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905350/extras/6806c0336ab6b739d1170dbf27e2bd38.webm?t=1753099496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905350/extras/6806c0336ab6b739d1170dbf27e2bd38.mp4?t=1753099496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explore the space of &quot;Chest&quot; dreams.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905350/extras/f9a46967e8c92d7f750d926a4f53b7c6.poster.avif?t=1753099496\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905350/extras/f9a46967e8c92d7f750d926a4f53b7c6.webm?t=1753099496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905350/extras/f9a46967e8c92d7f750d926a4f53b7c6.mp4?t=1753099496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Enjoy moments of relaxation accompanied by white noise, perhaps you can also use this time to do something else?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905350/extras/436166927d3b8ff0bd962823b3432072.poster.avif?t=1753099496\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905350/extras/436166927d3b8ff0bd962823b3432072.webm?t=1753099496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905350/extras/436166927d3b8ff0bd962823b3432072.mp4?t=1753099496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Layers of dreams!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905350/extras/f08a413fad8f06e152d8963cd43aebd2.poster.avif?t=1753099496\" width=616 height=190 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905350/extras/f08a413fad8f06e152d8963cd43aebd2.webm?t=1753099496\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2905350/extras/f08a413fad8f06e152d8963cd43aebd2.mp4?t=1753099496\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>And! Who is watching your dreams???",
